# Copy to apps/mobile/.env (optional — tagging works offline without this file)
#
# ── HuddleStat Cloud publish (optional) ──────────────────────────────────────
# Point at the huddlestat sync API. Requires sibling platform repo running
# `npm run dev:sync`, or a hosted HuddleStat sync URL.
#
# Physical iPad: use http://YOUR_MAC_LAN_IP:3001 (not 127.0.0.1)
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SYNC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.10:3001
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SYNC_API_KEY=dev-sync-key
#
# ── Public web dashboard link (optional) ─────────────────────────────────────
# EXPO_PUBLIC_WEB_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000
